      "Old Shanghai, New Fashion",
      "",
      "Living in Shanghai, when buying groceries in a supermarket, buying vegetables in a wet market, or having a walk in the park, ..",
      ".. you probably will often find Chinese people in their pajamas.",
      "Old Shanghai people live in traditional Shanghai alleys, and they know all the neighbors.",
